---
import SectionLayout from '../../layouts/SectionLayout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import PillButton from '../../components/PillButton.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---

<SectionLayout
	title="About the Chromosomal Instability Network"
	pageTitle="About the Network"
	description="A community of thirty-seven laboratories advancing chromosomal instability research from the bench to the clinic."
>
	<p slot="lead">
		A community of thirty-seven laboratories advancing chromosomal instability research from the
		bench to the clinic.
	</p>

	<section class="block">
		<Eyebrow>Who we are</Eyebrow>
		<h2>Uniting cell biology, genomics, and the clinic</h2>
		<p>
			CIN drives cancer formation and therapy resistance, but it also offers a chance to transform
			how we treat and prevent cancer. We are uniting cell biology, genomics, and the clinic to
			turn that potential into patient benefit.
		</p>
		<p>[Mission, history, and how the network is organized to come.]</p>
	</section>

	<section class="block">
		<Eyebrow>What we are working on</Eyebrow>
		<h2>Challenges and a shared roadmap</h2>
		<p>
			The network has identified three major challenges in CIN research and a roadmap for
			addressing them.
		</p>
		<PillButton href={url('about/challenges-and-roadmap/')}>See challenges and roadmap</PillButton>
	</section>

	<section class="block">
		<Eyebrow>Governance and funding</Eyebrow>
		<h2>[Governance]</h2>
		<p>[Steering group, funders, and how to get involved to come.]</p>
	</section>
</SectionLayout>

<style>
	h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 1.3rem + 1.6vw, 2.75rem);
	}
</style>
